    "Aucune des techniques de Sudokuno ne permet d'avancer ici : cette grille demande des méthodes encore plus avancées. On pose le %1$@ en %2$@, tiré de la solution, pour continuer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None of Sudokuno's techniques makes progress here: this puzzle needs even more advanced methods. We place %1$@ in %2$@, taken from the solution, to carry on."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geen van de technieken van Sudokuno helpt hier verder: deze puzzel vraagt nog geavanceerdere methodes. We plaatsen de %1$@ in %2$@, uit de oplossing, om verder te gaan."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nenhuma das técnicas do Sudokuno permite avançar aqui: esta grelha exige métodos ainda mais avançados. Colocamos o %1$@ em %2$@, retirado da solução, para continuar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sudokuno 的技巧在这里都无法推进：这道题需要更高级的方法。我们从答案中取出 %1$@ 填入 %2$@，以便继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
