    },
    "Ces grilles sont célèbres dans le monde entier pour leur difficulté. Aucune technique de Sudokuno n'en vient à bout : il faudra de très longues chaînes de raisonnement, ou des essais.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These puzzles are famous around the world for their difficulty. None of Sudokuno's techniques can crack them: you will need very long chains of reasoning, or trial and error."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze puzzels zijn wereldberoemd om hun moeilijkheid. Geen enkele techniek van Sudokuno kraakt ze: je hebt heel lange redeneerketens nodig, of moet gokken."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estes puzzles são famosos no mundo inteiro pela sua dificuldade. Nenhuma técnica do Sudokuno os resolve: vais precisar de cadeias de raciocínio muito longas, ou de tentativas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些数独以难度闻名于世。Sudokuno 的任何技巧都无法解开它们：你需要非常长的推理链，或者反复尝试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cette case est la plus contrainte de la grille.": {
