    "Célèbre chez les spécialistes pour son motif presque symétrique en croix : l'une des grilles les plus dures connues.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Famous among experts for its almost symmetrical cross pattern: one of the hardest puzzles known."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bij kenners beroemd om zijn bijna symmetrische kruispatroon: een van de moeilijkste bekende puzzels."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Famoso entre especialistas pelo seu padrão em cruz quase simétrico: um dos puzzles mais difíceis conhecidos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "因近乎对称的十字图案而在高手中闻名：已知最难的数独之一。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans %1$@, le %2$@ ne peut aller qu'en %3$@ : il est exclu de toutes les autres cases.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@, %2$@ can only go in %3$@: it is ruled out of every other cell."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@ kan de %2$@ alleen in %3$@: in alle andere vakjes is hij uitgesloten."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em %1$@, o %2$@ só pode ir em %3$@: está excluído de todas as outras casas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%1$@中，%2$@ 只能填在 %3$@：其他格子都已排除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans %1$@, les cases %2$@ ne contiennent ensemble que les candidats %3$@. Ces chiffres leur sont réservés : on les retire des autres cases dans %1$@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@, cells %2$@ together hold only the candidates %3$@. Those numbers are reserved for them: remove them from the other cells in %1$@."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@ bevatten de vakjes %2$@ samen alleen de kandidaten %3$@. Die cijfers zijn voor hen gereserveerd: verwijder ze uit de andere vakjes in %1$@."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em %1$@, as casas %2$@ contêm em conjunto apenas os candidatos %3$@. Esses números estão-lhes reservados: retiram-se das outras casas em %1$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%1$@中，格子 %2$@ 合起来只含候选数 %3$@。这些数字归它们所有：把它们从%1$@的其他格子中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans %1$@, les chiffres %2$@ ne peuvent aller que dans les cases %3$@. Ces cases leur sont réservées : on y retire tous les autres candidats.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@, the numbers %2$@ can only go in cells %3$@. Those cells are reserved for them: remove every other candidate from them."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@ kunnen de cijfers %2$@ alleen in de vakjes %3$@. Die vakjes zijn voor hen gereserveerd: verwijder daar alle andere kandidaten."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em %1$@, os números %2$@ só podem ir nas casas %3$@. Essas casas estão-lhes reservadas: retiram-se delas todos os outros candidatos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%1$@中，数字 %2$@ 只能填在格子 %3$@。这些格子归它们所有：删除其中所有其他候选数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans %1$@, toutes les places possibles du %2$@ se trouvent aussi dans %3$@. Le %2$@ occupera donc l'une d'elles : on le retire des autres cases dans %3$@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@, every possible place for %2$@ also lies in %3$@. So %2$@ will take one of them: remove it from the other cells in %3$@."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %1$@ liggen alle mogelijke plaatsen voor de %2$@ ook in %3$@. De %2$@ komt dus op een daarvan: verwijder hem uit de andere vakjes in %3$@."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em %1$@, todos os lugares possíveis do %2$@ ficam também em %3$@. O %2$@ ocupará portanto um deles: retira-se das outras casas em %3$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%1$@中，%2$@ 所有可能的位置同时也在%3$@中。因此 %2$@ 必定占据其中一格：把它从%3$@的其他格子中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans %2$@, le %1$@ n'a de place que dans %3$@. Il occupera forcément ces croisements : on le retire de toutes les autres cases dans %3$@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %2$@, %1$@ only fits in %3$@. It must take those crossings: remove it from every other cell in %3$@."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %2$@ past de %1$@ alleen in %3$@. Hij komt zeker op die kruispunten: verwijder hem uit alle andere vakjes in %3$@."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em %2$@, o %1$@ só tem lugar em %3$@. Ocupará forçosamente esses cruzamentos: retira-se de todas as outras casas em %3$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%2$@中，%1$@ 只能落在%3$@。它必定占据这些交叉点：把它从%3$@的其他格子中删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans %@, un des chiffres manquants ne peut aller que dans cette case. Lequel ?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, one of the missing numbers can only go in this cell. Which one?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@ kan één van de ontbrekende cijfers alleen in dit vakje. Welk?"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em %@, um dos números em falta só pode ir para esta casa. Qual?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%@中，有一个缺少的数字只能填在这个格子里。是哪个？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dans cette case, un seul chiffre est encore possible. Lequel ?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only one number is still possible in this cell. Which one?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In dit vakje is nog maar één cijfer mogelijk. Welk?"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nesta casa, só um número ainda é possível. Qual?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个格子只剩一个可能的数字。是哪个？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demande des techniques au-delà des classiques.": {
