    "Le Sudoku du jour est prêt. Lance ta série 🔥": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Daily Sudoku is ready. Start your streak 🔥"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De Sudoku van de dag staat klaar. Start je reeks 🔥"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Sudoku do dia está pronto. Começa a tua série 🔥"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日数独已就绪，开启你的连胜 🔥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le code contient toute ta grille : tes amis retrouvent exactement la même, même hors ligne.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The code contains your whole puzzle: your friends get exactly the same one, even offline."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De code bevat je hele puzzel: je vrienden krijgen precies dezelfde, zelfs offline."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O código contém a grelha inteira: os teus amigos obtêm exatamente a mesma, mesmo offline."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码包含整道谜题：朋友即使离线也能获得完全相同的谜题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le nombre d'indices utilisés apparaît à la fin de la partie, dans les messages partagés et dans les classements Game Center. Le réglage s'applique aux nouvelles parties.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The number of hints used appears at the end of the game, in shared messages and in Game Center leaderboards. The setting applies to new games."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het aantal gebruikte hints verschijnt aan het einde van de partij, in gedeelde berichten en in de Game Center-ranglijsten. De instelling geldt voor nieuwe partijen."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O número de dicas usadas aparece no fim do jogo, nas mensagens partilhadas e nas classificações do Game Center. A definição aplica-se aos novos jogos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用的提示次数会显示在游戏结束时、分享的消息以及 Game Center 排行榜中。此设置对新游戏生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le paiement doit encore être validé. Merci de ta patience !": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The payment still needs to be approved. Thanks for your patience!"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De betaling moet nog worden goedgekeurd. Bedankt voor je geduld!"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O pagamento ainda tem de ser aprovado. Obrigado pela paciência!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "付款仍需确认，感谢你的耐心！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le pivot %1$@ et ses deux ailes (%2$@) contiennent tous le %3$@, et l'une de ces trois cases le prendra forcément. Une case qui voit les trois ne peut donc pas contenir le %3$@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pivot %1$@ and its two wings (%2$@) all hold %3$@, and one of these three cells must take it. So a cell that sees all three cannot hold %3$@."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De spil %1$@ en zijn twee vleugels (%2$@) bevatten allemaal de %3$@, en een van deze drie vakjes krijgt hem zeker. Een vakje dat alle drie ziet, kan dus geen %3$@ bevatten."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O pivô %1$@ e as suas duas asas (%2$@) contêm todos o %3$@, e uma destas três casas ficará forçosamente com ele. Uma casa que vê as três não pode portanto conter o %3$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "枢纽格 %1$@ 和它的两个翼格（%2$@）都含有 %3$@，三格之一必为 %3$@。因此同时看到这三格的格子不可能是 %3$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le pivot %1$@ n'a que deux candidats. Quel que soit le bon, l'une des deux ailes (%2$@) prendra le %3$@. Une case qui voit les deux ailes ne peut donc pas contenir le %3$@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pivot %1$@ has only two candidates. Whichever is right, one of the two wings (%2$@) will be %3$@. So a cell that sees both wings cannot hold %3$@."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De spil %1$@ heeft maar twee kandidaten. Welke ook klopt, een van de twee vleugels (%2$@) wordt de %3$@. Een vakje dat beide vleugels ziet, kan dus geen %3$@ bevatten."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O pivô %1$@ só tem dois candidatos. Seja qual for o certo, uma das duas asas (%2$@) ficará com o %3$@. Uma casa que vê as duas asas não pode portanto conter o %3$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "枢纽格 %1$@ 只有两个候选数。无论哪个正确，两个翼格（%2$@）之一必为 %3$@。因此同时看到两个翼格的格子不可能是 %3$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
