    "Les techniques classiques ne suffisent plus : on raisonne par l'absurde. Supposons que %1$@ contienne le %2$@. Voici ce que cela impose, coup après coup :": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The classic techniques are no longer enough: we reason by contradiction. Suppose %1$@ holds %2$@. Here is what that forces, move after move:"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De klassieke technieken volstaan niet meer: we redeneren uit het ongerijmde. Stel dat %1$@ de %2$@ bevat. Dit volgt daar dan dwingend uit, zet na zet:"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As técnicas clássicas já não chegam: raciocinamos por absurdo. Suponhamos que %1$@ contém o %2$@. Eis o que isso obriga, jogada após jogada:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经典技巧已经不够用：我们用反证法。假设 %1$@ 填 %2$@，那么必然依次得到："
          }
        }
      }
    },
